        <h2>How to Calculate Fuel Cost for a Trip or Journey</h2>
        <p>When planning a road trip or carpool journey, one of the most common oversights is calculating only the one-way distance while forgetting the return journey.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs not-prose">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-3.5 bg-white dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950">
