            <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              Total distance equals the one-way odometer distance between starting point and destination.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-2 font-mono text-amber-600 font-bold">Total Distance = One-Way Distance</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 p-3.5 bg-amber-50/50 dark:border-amber-900/60 dark:bg-amber-950/20">
