        <p>Because fuel prices vary across Indian states and union territories (due to state VAT and cess differences between Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru, UP, etc.), our tool requires you to input your current local fuel rate rather than relying on outdated assumptions.</p>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-800/40 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 not-prose">
